<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="wrap narrow">
  <h1>用手機號碼繼續</h1>
  <p>輸入台灣手機號碼。我們會用簡訊驗證碼確認是你。這裡不設定密碼，也不收集身分證或護照。</p>
  <form method="post" action="/login">
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
    <div class="field">
      <label for="mobile">手機號碼</label>
      <input id="mobile" name="mobile" type="tel" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="0912345678" required>
    </div>
    <button type="submit">取得驗證碼</button>
  </form>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
